[36m(TaskRunner pid=286723)[0m - \( 97_b = 9 \cdot b + 7 \)
[36m(TaskRunner pid=286723)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=286723)[0m We need \( b + 7 \) to divide \( 9b + 7 \). This can be expressed as:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=286723)[0m \[ 9b + 7 = k \cdot (b + 7) \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=286723)[0m for some integer \( k \).
