[36m(TaskRunner pid=286723)[0m \[ 9b - kb = 7k - 7 \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=286723)[0m \[ b(9 - k) = 7(k - 1) \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=286723)[0m \[ b = \frac{7(k - 1)}{9 - k} \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=286723)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=286723)[0m For \( b \) to be an integer greater than 9, \( \frac{7(k - 1)}{9 - k} \) must be an integer. We denote \( d = 9 - k \), so the equation becomes:
