[36m(TaskRunner pid=286723)[0m - For \( b = 49 \), \( 17_{49} = 56 \) and \( 97_{49} = 448 \). \( 448 \div 56 = 8 \), which is an integer.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=286723)[0m 
